      "name": "00 Avonent Before/After",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "FROM PLATE TO COMFORT",
        "heading": "A heavy meal asks your digestion to do five jobs at once.",
        "intro": "<p>Protein. Fats. Carbohydrates. Fiber. Lactose. One mixed meal can contain all five—and each one requires different digestive support.</p>",
        "before_tab": "Before Support",
        "before_label": "THE HEAVY-MEAL PROBLEM",
        "before_image": "shopify://shop_images/A7162ED3-B2D7-4591-BD38-CD872AE47EAA.png",
        "before_image_alt": "Conceptual illustration of a complex mixed meal during digestion",
        "before_heading": "One meal. A lot to break down.",
        "before_text": "<p>Rich, complicated meals can sometimes leave you feeling bloated, gassy, overly full, or weighed down long after the last bite.</p>",
        "before_points": "<ul><li>Protein, fats, carbs, fiber, and dairy all require different digestive work</li><li>Mixed meals can be harder to handle than a single type of food</li><li>Occasional pressure, gas, and uncomfortable fullness can follow</li></ul>",
        "after_tab": "With Avonent",
        "after_label": "WITH AVONENT SUPPORT",
        "after_image": "shopify://shop_images/660F3A1D-A9A8-4C2B-8F91-A77754AB205A.png",
        "after_image_alt": "Conceptual illustration of Avonent supporting mixed-meal digestion",
        "after_heading": "Support for the whole plate.",
        "after_text": "<p>Avonent combines five digestive enzymes to help break down protein, fats, carbohydrates, fiber, and lactose—plus artichoke, ox bile, slippery elm, and targeted botanicals for more complete digestive support.</p>",
        "after_points": "<ul><li>Broad enzyme support for every part of a mixed meal</li><li>Additional support for normal fat digestion and bile activity</li><li>Designed to support post-meal comfort and help with occasional bloating</li></ul>",
        "process_heading": "How Avonent supports the process",
        "closing_heading": "Made for real meals. Not perfect diets.",
        "closing_text": "<p>Protein-heavy lunches. Restaurant dinners. Dairy. Takeout nights. Avonent provides broader digestive support for the food you actually eat.</p>",
        "button_label": "SUPPORT YOUR NEXT MEAL",
        "button_link": "",
        "disclaimer": "",
